                  "purpose":  "Documented expected-truth table for the cache-honesty mock fixtures (WI-0). States which ASSIGNED reviewer SHOULD show complete/incomplete per campaign per cert. Downstream WI-1 (red repro) and WI-11 (end-to-end proof) assert the rendered who-completed/who-did-not against this file.",
